* Fixture: PERFORM call to a keyword-named subroutine
* Tests that PERFORM resolves to a subroutine named after a Natural keyword (CLEAR, RESET)
* Issue #41: keyword-named subroutines were losing their identity due to parseSubroutine
* checking only TokenIdentifier, not TokenKeyword.

DEFINE SUBROUTINE CLEAR
  WRITE 'In CLEAR subroutine'
END-SUBROUTINE

DEFINE SUBROUTINE RESET
  WRITE 'In RESET subroutine'
END SUBROUTINE

* External PERFORM to keyword-named subroutines
PERFORM CLEAR

PERFORM RESET

* Control: non-keyword subroutine names still work
DEFINE SUBROUTINE MY-SUB
  WRITE 'In MY-SUB'
END-SUBROUTINE

PERFORM MY-SUB

END
